ting which","Mon, 03 Aug 2026 05:47:23 +0530",https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/us-senate-leaders-reach-funding-deal-to-avoid-shutdown-during-campaign-season/article71299454.ece,2026-08-03 01:30:51
