ep slopes ar","Sun, 02 Aug 2026 17:11:50 +0530",https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/veteran-mountaineer-purjas-body-found-three-days-after-avalanche-on-broad-peak-in-pok/article71297621.ece,2026-08-03 01:30:55
