tary action or changed its position on reope","Monday, August 03, 2026, 04:50  +0530",https://zeenews.india.com/world/trump-the-fool-has-run-out-of-steam-how-iran-trolled-trump-after-he-called-off-planned-strikes-3064417.html,2026-08-03 01:31:39
