s Natland sent a brief message to his girlfriend, “I am going on a dangerous mi","Monday, August 03, 2026, 00:02  +0530",https://zeenews.india.com/world/iran-sweden-and-a-teenage-hitman-how-the-foxtrot-network-became-europe-s-most-feared-crime-syndicate-3064412.html,2026-08-03 01:31:40
